`^\s*(?:@\[[^\]]*\]\s*)?(?:private\s+|protected\s+|noncomputable\s+|partial\s+|unsafe\s+|scoped\s+|local\s+)*?(theorem|lemma|def|abbrev|structure|class|instance|axiom|opaque|example)\s+([A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_'\.]*)`

